    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d703">

                <pb facs="0628" n="622" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg622"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.8212a/12</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Walton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 329</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-08-21">August 21, 1939</date>.<lb/>[Received September
                        19.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to Department’s instruction No.
                    137, July 6, 1939, I have the honor to transmit herewith Conciliation Treaty
                    between <pb facs="0629" n="623" xml:id="pg623"/> the United States of America
                    and Liberia, signed at Monrovia August 21, 1939, at 1:30 p.m.<anchor n="62"
                        xml:id="d703-f1"/></p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lester A. Walton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d703-f1" n="62" xml:id="d703-f1-content">
                <p>For text, see Department of State Treaty Series No. 968, or 55 Stat. 1137.</p>
